WEBVTT

00:13:29.276 --> 00:13:30.802
To the prisoners, we said,

00:13:30.826 --> 00:13:32.952
"Wait at home. The study
will begin Sunday."

00:13:32.976 --> 00:13:34.176
We didn't tell them

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.395
that the city police were going
to come and do realistic arrests.

00:13:37.419 --> 00:13:39.051
(Video) (Music)

00:13:43.839 --> 00:13:45.039
[Day 1]